Message-ID: <7ffnlZWJZ8E.bqIOpQT3p-gJ@ggplot2-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2-dev/c/7ffnlZWJZ8E/m/bqIOpQT3p-gJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

It would be convenient if higher level objects such as Geom, Stat, etc. had objname components (like lower level ones already do) so that if one is mucking around in the runtime structures that one can quickly know where one is.  Alternately use the component name ..Name in place of objname which name.proto in the proto package will already use, if present, to find a meaningful name.

